    "title": "Hunter Biden & Right-Wing Podcaster Nick Fuentes Nearly Get Into Fist Fight During Interview - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Alessio Atria uInterview 2 hours ago 💬 0",
    "summary": "49 minutes ago Former first son Hunter Biden and conservative podcaster Nick Fuentes had an argument during an interview that almost became a physical altercation. Biden has been taking a more active approach to reshaping his reputation marred by drug and salacious photos . This interview, which took place in a Philadelphia motel room on July 12, was conducted by journalist Andrew Callaghan for his YouTube series Channel 5. The interview took place after Fuentes contacted Callaghan’s publicist, saying that he hoped to clear up any misconceptions about himself with the public .",
